        Setup commands used in the PREFERENCES for COMPUTERTYPES
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------


NUMBER_COMPUTERTYPES     (pn)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Number of computertypes you want to use

NAMECOMTYPE(n)           (pt)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Name of computer type
